      "id": "survey-selected-model",
      "subject": "DAMIT 5939: selected shape and spin",
      "status": "included",
      "finding": "The official DAMIT metadata export was joined by model and asteroid identity and compared with the selected local recipe shape/model-5939.txt. Model 5939, version 2022-02-14, pole (47°, 24°), period 37.118 h match the retained metadata. The archive supplies no diameter for this model; a separate scale constraint is required. This comparison checks source identity and metadata, not fresh mesh bytes, registration or the completeness of other archives.",
